deepml motion 0.3
module corpus.deepml_motion.example_01340
policy deterministic
policy no_network
skeleton Rig01340 { joint Root parent none joint Hip parent Root joint Knee parent Hip joint Foot parent Knee }
blend_tree Locomotion01340 parameter speed { idle at 0 walk at 1 run at 3 }
